198
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:56,759
A Yuan.

199
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,120
Help me.

200
00:12:58,519 --> 00:12:59,000
A Yuan.

201
00:13:13,399 --> 00:13:13,879
A Yuan.

202
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,480
