216
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:19,200
What about Lu Haifeng?

217
00:14:24,360 --> 00:14:24,879
Dead.

218
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,720
What about the woman?

219
00:14:32,639 --> 00:14:33,279
Which woman?

220
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:36,360
Yuan Lai.

221
00:14:37,320 --> 00:14:37,879
Is she dead?

222
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:53,039
Yes, that's her.

223
00:14:55,799 --> 00:14:56,279
Where is she?

224
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:00,159
Didn't Pei Laosan tell you

225
00:15:00,159 --> 00:15:02,320
