230
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:19,519
On it.

231
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:22,399
Everyone, just cooperate.

232
00:15:22,759 --> 00:15:23,879
Don't make things hard for yourselves.

233
00:15:36,279 --> 00:15:36,879
Clear.

234
00:15:45,679 --> 00:15:46,039
