255
00:18:20,039 --> 00:18:21,119
I was really scared,

256
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:23,039
so I ran downstairs.

257
00:18:24,839 --> 00:18:25,880
I had just gone down one floor

258
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,319
