259
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,240
Are you sure we fell together?

260
00:18:34,359 --> 00:18:34,960
I'm sure.

261
00:18:36,599 --> 00:18:37,880
Did you see me... me...

262
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:38,640
pulling him down?

263
00:18:39,200 --> 00:18:41,480
Even just a pulling motion?

264
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:45,160
I didn't see that.

265
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,160
Based on Heihai's confession

266
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,119
and all the clues we currently have,

267
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:55,279
we've pieced together

268
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:56,799
the logical chain of the entire case.

269
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:59,440
Comrade Ji Min's suspicion at the time

270
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:00,920
