273
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,839
Yuan Lai is the 'Spring Snow' drug maker.

274
00:19:08,480 --> 00:19:09,559
And right around this time,

275
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:12,000
Yuan Lai happened to escape

276
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,279
from Lu Haifeng to Old Street.

277
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:14,680
The timelines match perfectly.

278
00:19:15,079 --> 00:19:15,759
As for Er Hai,

279
00:19:16,119 --> 00:19:17,759
