283
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,000
The two fled to Red Leaf,

284
00:19:26,279 --> 00:19:29,039
and met Jin Yonggang through Pei Laosan.

285
00:19:29,599 --> 00:19:32,720
Then the Old Street shooting happened,

286
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,680
