287
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,359
The person who texted Mr. Bai

288
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:45,000
was most likely Ding Yong.

289
00:19:46,079 --> 00:19:47,000
As for his cause of death,

290
00:19:47,960 --> 00:19:49,279
it's highly likely that

291
00:19:49,839 --> 00:19:51,480
Lu Haifeng killed him out of revenge.

292
00:19:52,359 --> 00:19:54,720
We've also confirmed how Shuahai died.

293
00:19:55,359 --> 00:19:57,839
Ding Yong did it on Lu Haifeng's orders,

294
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:58,400
along with his men.

295
00:19:59,519 --> 00:20:01,440
We caught two of Lu Haifeng's men.

296
00:20:01,759 --> 00:20:03,240
They confessed to being involved.

297
00:20:04,160 --> 00:20:04,720
Furthermore,

298
00:20:04,839 --> 00:20:07,000
As for the murdered Elite Club guard,

299
00:20:07,519 --> 00:20:08,839
Heihai confessed that Shuahai

300
00:20:09,160 --> 00:20:10,640
was the one who killed Liu Ming.

301
00:20:11,839 --> 00:20:12,960
The motive for murder was simple:

302
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:14,839
just to intimidate Lu Haifeng.

303
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:16,839
Chief Guo,

304
00:20:17,559 --> 00:20:19,039
Economic Crime Investigation Unit has news.

305
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:22,680
Through one of Yuan Lai's bank cards,

306
00:20:23,160 --> 00:20:26,279
we traced Lu Haifeng's transfer records.

307
00:20:26,599 --> 00:20:28,079
The source of the money is fine,

308
00:20:28,720 --> 00:20:31,440
but the time of each transfer

309
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,200
is highly suspicious.

310
00:20:32,799 --> 00:20:36,160
They match 'Spring Snow' shipping dates

311
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:37,640
in this ledger.

312
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:40,160
So the Economic Crime Investigation Unit

313
00:20:40,400 --> 00:20:42,079
suspects that this money is very likely

314
00:20:42,960 --> 00:20:46,160
the wages Lu Haifeng paid to Yuan Lai.

315
00:20:47,359 --> 00:20:48,039
In addition,

316
00:20:48,519 --> 00:20:50,279
regarding the chemical plant drug lab,

317
00:20:50,359 --> 00:20:51,640
we searched it three times.

318
00:20:52,440 --> 00:20:53,400
Through a single strand of hair,

319
00:20:53,559 --> 00:20:54,640
we've already concluded

320
00:20:55,039 --> 00:20:56,039
that its DNA

321
00:20:56,039 --> 00:20:56,799
matches Yuan Lai's.

322
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:58,759
So now, based on this evidence,

323
00:20:59,519 --> 00:21:01,000
Yuan Lai being the maker of "Spring Snow"

324
00:21:01,759 --> 00:21:02,240
is highly probable.

325
00:21:07,359 --> 00:21:09,039
With this confession and evidence,

326
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:10,200
can we make an arrest?

327
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:11,359
Yes.

328
00:21:12,519 --> 00:21:14,039
But if she firmly denies everything,

329
00:21:14,039 --> 00:21:15,680
it'll still be hard to convict her.

330
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:19,000
Then hurry up and interrogate her.

331
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:21,720
Get her confession as soon as possible.

332
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:22,839
Understood.

333
00:21:26,039 --> 00:21:26,559
Anything else?

334
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:31,720
What else?

335
00:21:32,599 --> 00:21:34,160
There's one more thing we want to discuss.

336
00:21:34,839 --> 00:21:35,799
It's about...

337
00:21:36,519 --> 00:21:37,680
Liao Bufan... Chief Liao.

338
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:38,720
I was thinking...

339
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,480
let him talk to Yuan Lai first.

340
00:21:41,799 --> 00:21:42,240
Right?

341
00:21:43,039 --> 00:21:43,799
Right, right.

342
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:46,839
A talk is fine.

343
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:50,440
Mainly because this bank card

344
00:21:50,440 --> 00:21:52,480
was also provided by Chief Liao.

345
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:54,400
Economic Crime Investigation Unit thinks

346
00:21:54,839 --> 00:21:57,079
if Chief Liao could talk to her,

347
00:21:57,279 --> 00:21:58,640
we might just get an

348
00:21:58,839 --> 00:22:00,119
unexpected result.

349
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,759
Right? Right?

350
00:22:03,119 --> 00:22:03,680
Indeed.

351
00:22:03,799 --> 00:22:05,119
From the hostage rescue

352
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:07,720
to treating Naonao's gunshot stress disorder,

353
00:22:08,039 --> 00:22:09,960
Yuan Lai trusts Liao Bufan quite a bit.

354
00:22:10,519 --> 00:22:13,480
Maybe Yuan Lai will tell him something.

355
00:22:14,279 --> 00:22:14,799
See?

356
00:22:22,079 --> 00:22:23,400
Since it'll help the case,

357
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:26,000
let him give it a try.

358
00:22:27,279 --> 00:22:29,640
But not as a formal interrogation.

359
00:22:29,839 --> 00:22:30,759
Just a routine conversation.

360
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,319
The specific details of their talk,

361
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:34,880
you can verify later.

362
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:36,880
Understood.

363
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,279
Understood.

364
00:22:56,039 --> 00:22:56,920
Captain Zhang, Captain Na.

365
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,440
Liang Dayin has been arrested.

366
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:00,839
He confessed to everything right away.

367
00:23:01,599 --> 00:23:03,119
He sent Yuan Lai's identity

368
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:04,279
as a drug maker to Mr. Bai.

369
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,519
The mole wasn't Da Yong.

370
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,000
How are you doing?

371
00:23:23,079 --> 00:23:23,519
I'm alright.

372
00:23:24,480 --> 00:23:25,079
And Naonao?

373
00:23:25,640 --> 00:23:26,200
Behaving well?

374
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:27,440
Yes, very.

375
00:23:28,200 --> 00:23:28,680
Very well-behaved.

376
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:34,640
You've had it rough these past few years.

377
00:23:39,279 --> 00:23:40,440
For this child.

378
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,039
It's nothing.

379
00:23:51,000 --> 00:23:52,759
Can you tell me about your past?

380
00:23:59,599 --> 00:24:00,680
It's all in the past.

381
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,119
There's nothing to tell.

382
00:24:07,359 --> 00:24:09,079
Then do you want to hear about my past?

383
00:24:19,880 --> 00:24:20,640
I

384
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:24,720
never met my dad.

385
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:29,119
My mom said my dad was a hero,

386
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:34,680
always out on important missions.

387
00:24:36,559 --> 00:24:38,920
He could only come home after the mission.

388
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,640
I waited...

389
00:24:46,519 --> 00:24:47,119
and waited...

390
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:52,440
I was thinking back then,

391
00:24:52,640 --> 00:24:55,119
how huge must my dad's mission be?

392
00:25:02,319 --> 00:25:04,440
One night, my mom was hospitalized.

393
00:25:07,039 --> 00:25:08,880
The doctor said she needed a new kidney.

394
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:13,480
We didn't have much money back then.

395
00:25:16,599 --> 00:25:17,440
So I asked my mom,

396
00:25:17,960 --> 00:25:18,440
I said, "Mom,

397
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:20,599
when is Dad coming back?"

398
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:24,200
My mom looked at me for a while,

399
00:25:25,079 --> 00:25:27,400
calmed herself down, and said,

400
00:25:28,720 --> 00:25:30,319
"Son, you look exhausted.

401
00:25:30,359 --> 00:25:30,960
Go get some sleep.

402
00:25:32,039 --> 00:25:33,079
Everything will be fine when you wake up."

403
00:25:35,359 --> 00:25:36,559
So I really did fall asleep.

404
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:38,680
And in my dream,

405
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,319
I actually got to see my dad.

406
00:25:40,680 --> 00:25:41,400
I was so happy.

407
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,920
I was so happy, but then I woke up.

408
00:25:43,359 --> 00:25:45,000
As soon as I woke up, the doctor told me

409
00:25:45,440 --> 00:25:46,039
that my mom was gone.

410
00:25:53,599 --> 00:25:54,839
That's why I told you the other day

411
00:25:58,680 --> 00:26:00,119
that Naonao and I are quite alike.

412
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:10,000
It wasn't that my mom didn't know.

413
00:26:10,960 --> 00:26:13,680
She just didn't want to tell me

414
00:26:15,079 --> 00:26:17,440
that my so-called hero of a dad

415
00:26:18,599 --> 00:26:19,519
had abandoned us.

416
00:26:30,599 --> 00:26:32,119
Since you've been gone,

417
00:26:33,039 --> 00:26:34,519
Naonao has asked about you every day.

418
00:26:36,480 --> 00:26:38,960
"When will my mom get better?"

419
00:26:40,680 --> 00:26:43,920
"When can my mom see me?"

420
00:26:44,359 --> 00:26:46,160
"When can I call her?"

421
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:49,279
I've been making up lies every single day.

422
00:26:50,079 --> 00:26:51,400
I really can't keep lying anymore.

423
00:27:01,519 --> 00:27:02,440
But

424
00:27:05,519 --> 00:27:07,240
a white lie like this

425
00:27:11,480 --> 00:27:13,079
is just to help us keep going.

426
00:27:17,880 --> 00:27:18,960
The price is painful.

427
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:25,200
Lies are painful.

428
00:27:28,319 --> 00:27:29,400
And what about honesty?

429
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,279
Does it guarantee happiness?

430
00:27:37,000 --> 00:27:38,279
It might be cruel,

431
00:27:39,759 --> 00:27:40,920
but at least it's real.

432
00:27:43,759 --> 00:27:44,119
Yuan Lai,

433
00:27:46,119 --> 00:27:47,000
to Naonao,

434
00:27:49,680 --> 00:27:51,079
you are his whole world.

435
00:27:52,759 --> 00:27:53,559
As long as you're real,

436
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:56,599
his world is real.

437
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:52,640
Please take good care of Naonao for me.

438
00:28:55,519 --> 00:28:56,119
Don't worry.

439
00:28:58,039 --> 00:28:59,480
I'll be there as Naonao grows up.

440
00:29:01,680 --> 00:29:02,279
I promise.

441
00:30:58,680 --> 00:30:59,039
Okay.

442
00:30:59,799 --> 00:31:00,440
Got it.

443
00:31:04,119 --> 00:31:04,559
Goodbye.

444
00:31:24,640 --> 00:31:25,160
Hello?

445
00:31:26,119 --> 00:31:26,839
Political Department.

446
00:31:28,759 --> 00:31:30,079
About Tan Yan's First-Class Merit,

447
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,240
wait until the case is closed

448
00:31:33,599 --> 00:31:34,400
to discuss it further.

449
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:40,480
Come in.

450
00:31:41,799 --> 00:31:42,319
Chief Guo.

451
00:31:43,960 --> 00:31:44,440
Come, come.

452
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:46,240
Have a seat.

453
00:31:47,200 --> 00:31:48,240
How's your recovery going?

454
00:31:49,480 --> 00:31:50,400
Fully recovered?

455
00:31:50,759 --> 00:31:51,200
That's great.

456
00:31:51,599 --> 00:31:53,079
You look quite sharp in that uniform.

457
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:56,799
You wouldn't be here without a reason.

458
00:31:58,400 --> 00:32:00,759
I have something to report.

459
00:32:01,480 --> 00:32:02,119
Is it well thought out?

460
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:03,680
It is.

461
00:32:04,240 --> 00:32:04,640
Go ahead.

462
00:32:05,640 --> 00:32:06,160
Chief Guo,

463
00:32:07,319 --> 00:32:09,000
after the case is closed, can we not apply

464
00:32:09,319 --> 00:32:10,079
for the First-Class Merit?

465
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,400
Not apply?

466
00:32:12,839 --> 00:32:13,640
Why?

467
00:32:16,559 --> 00:32:18,799
I think Lu Haifeng's death is suspicious.

468
00:32:20,720 --> 00:32:22,200
What's suspicious? Tell me.

469
00:32:25,799 --> 00:32:26,799
I went to see Yuan Lai.

470
00:32:30,079 --> 00:32:33,799
She said Lu Haifeng and I fell together.

471
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:36,160
I asked her

472
00:32:36,599 --> 00:32:39,000
if I made a move to pull Lu Haifeng.

473
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:40,960
She said she didn't see it.

474
00:32:42,839 --> 00:32:44,119
I thought about it carefully,

475
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:47,240
and I reconstructed what happened.

476
00:32:48,839 --> 00:32:50,279
I'm really not sure

477
00:32:50,359 --> 00:32:52,440
how Lu Haifeng fell.

478
00:32:53,279 --> 00:32:54,200
But I am certain

479
00:32:55,119 --> 00:32:57,079
that Lu Haifeng didn't fall straight down.

480
00:32:58,319 --> 00:32:59,359
Before I passed out,

481
00:32:59,880 --> 00:33:01,960
I think I heard him... calling for help.

482
00:33:03,599 --> 00:33:06,599
There were only three of us at the scene.

483
00:33:06,839 --> 00:33:08,200
Me, Lu Haifeng, and Yuan Lai.

484
00:33:09,839 --> 00:33:10,920
About this situation of yours,

485
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:12,319
does Zhang Peng know?

486
00:33:13,440 --> 00:33:14,240
I haven't told him.

487
00:33:15,240 --> 00:33:16,920
I was dazed from the fall...

488
00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:19,839
Dazed from the fall?

489
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,440
"You think?"

490
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:26,319
Meaning you're not sure, right?

491
00:33:28,640 --> 00:33:29,519
I'm not sure.

492
00:33:30,079 --> 00:33:30,880
But I had that...

493
00:33:31,079 --> 00:33:32,240
planned out for you.

494
00:33:33,160 --> 00:33:34,400
Now you're not sure.

495
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:42,079
An uncertain merit like this...

496
00:33:43,920 --> 00:33:45,000
isn't a merit at all.

497
00:33:47,680 --> 00:33:48,599
Tan Yan,

498
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:51,599
do you know what this First-Class Merit

499
00:33:52,319 --> 00:33:53,240
means?

500
00:33:54,279 --> 00:33:55,920
It's not something you can earn

501
00:33:56,400 --> 00:33:57,599
with just courage.

502
00:33:58,880 --> 00:33:59,359
You...

503
00:33:59,799 --> 00:34:00,799
an opportunity like this

504
00:34:03,119 --> 00:34:05,799
might not come around a second time.

505
00:34:06,519 --> 00:34:07,519
You need to think this through.

506
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:11,960
Besides, in the next couple of years,

507
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:14,840
if you earn a First-Class Merit,

508
00:34:15,719 --> 00:34:17,320
you'll have great prospects.

509
00:34:19,840 --> 00:34:20,880
Here's what we'll do. Listen to me.

510
00:34:22,239 --> 00:34:22,880
Don't be so impulsive.

511
00:34:24,119 --> 00:34:26,519
Go back. I'll give you a day.

512
00:34:26,639 --> 00:34:27,760
Think it over carefully.

513
00:34:56,639 --> 00:34:58,519
Chief Guo, I've thought about it.

514
00:34:59,440 --> 00:35:01,039
This questionable First-Class Merit...

515
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:02,440
I think I'll pass.

516
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:05,639
But your concern for me warms my heart.

517
00:35:06,559 --> 00:35:08,559
I'll keep doing my best in the future.

518
00:35:12,320 --> 00:35:13,079
This kid...

519
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:15,400
Looks like he's fully recovered.

520
00:35:44,960 --> 00:35:45,480
Honey.

521
00:35:47,239 --> 00:35:48,280
I explained the situation.

522
00:35:51,960 --> 00:35:52,760
Just now.

523
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,800
Right in front of Chief Guo.

524
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:58,280
All right.

525
00:35:59,480 --> 00:36:00,320
Come home tonight then.

526
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:02,039
I'm craving dumplings.

527
00:36:03,440 --> 00:36:05,400
Sure. What kind of filling?

528
00:36:08,039 --> 00:36:08,639
It happens to be the weekend.

529
00:36:09,039 --> 00:36:09,760
I'll put in a request.

530
00:36:09,960 --> 00:36:10,679
We can have a few drinks.

531
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:12,920
I made "Spring Snow."

532
00:36:14,239 --> 00:36:16,039
When I first got together with Lu Haifeng,

533
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:19,599
I did experiments at his chemical plant.

534
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:25,400
He said he wanted to make a detox drug.

535
00:36:26,920 --> 00:36:28,320
And I believed him.

536
00:36:30,519 --> 00:36:31,440
"Spring Snow"...

537
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:34,960
...was just the product of a failed test.

538
00:36:38,360 --> 00:36:40,159
Why make it if you knew it was a drug?

539
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:44,480
What would happen to my child if I didn't?

540
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,840
I killed Lu Haifeng too.

541
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,559
When he and Political Commissar Tan

542
00:36:55,719 --> 00:36:57,239
fell off the rooftop,

543
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:57,800
A Yuan!

544
00:36:58,920 --> 00:37:00,519
he grabbed the edge of the roof.

545
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:03,239
A Yuan, help me!

546
00:37:06,039 --> 00:37:06,719
A Yuan!

547
00:37:07,119 --> 00:37:07,719
A Yuan!

548
00:37:08,159 --> 00:37:08,840
A Yuan!

549
00:37:09,960 --> 00:37:10,960
I'm so lucky. Thank God you're here.

550
00:37:11,920 --> 00:37:13,400
Thank you. Thank you.

551
00:37:18,559 --> 00:37:19,039
A Yuan!

552
00:37:19,840 --> 00:37:20,599
A Yuan, what are you doing?

553
00:37:21,360 --> 00:37:21,880
A Yuan!

554
00:37:22,440 --> 00:37:23,239
A Yuan, help me!

555
00:37:23,519 --> 00:37:24,079
A Yuan!

556
00:37:27,639 --> 00:37:28,639
Why did you kill him?

557
00:37:29,079 --> 00:37:30,599
Didn't someone like him deserve to die?

558
00:37:34,480 --> 00:37:35,159
Naonao...

559
00:37:36,199 --> 00:37:38,280
...is my only reason to live.

560
00:37:40,679 --> 00:37:42,079
Ever since the day he used my child's life

561
00:37:42,079 --> 00:37:43,480
to threaten me,

562
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:44,639
I wanted to kill him.

563
00:37:46,599 --> 00:37:47,519
Only if he died

564
00:37:48,199 --> 00:37:49,800
would my identity remain a secret.

565
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,920
Then I could start a new life with Naonao.

566
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:54,119
You think that just because he's dead,

567
00:37:54,119 --> 00:37:55,559
no one knows your identity?

568
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:07,880
He's already in custody.

569
00:38:51,239 --> 00:38:52,639
When did you get back?

570
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:54,760
You didn't even make a sound.

571
00:38:55,599 --> 00:38:56,639
When will the dumplings be ready?

572
00:38:57,320 --> 00:38:58,719
I was just waiting for you.

573
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:00,760
Turning on the stove. In go the dumplings.

574
00:39:02,960 --> 00:39:04,239
Today, I prepared

575
00:39:04,239 --> 00:39:06,199
beef and carrot filling,

576
00:39:06,639 --> 00:39:08,840
as well as chive, egg, and shrimp.

577
00:39:09,559 --> 00:39:11,639
Go wash your hands and rest for a bit.

578
00:39:13,360 --> 00:39:14,440
It'll be quick. Ten minutes.

579
00:39:15,079 --> 00:39:16,559
12 minutes, max.

580
00:39:40,519 --> 00:39:41,000
Sit down.

581
00:39:42,239 --> 00:39:42,679
All right.

582
00:39:49,559 --> 00:39:50,320
Say when.

583
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:51,800
A little more.

584
00:39:54,360 --> 00:39:54,840
Is that enough?

585
00:39:54,840 --> 00:39:55,039
That's enough.

586
00:39:59,039 --> 00:39:59,519
Here.

587
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:01,119
Try one.

588
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:02,920
It's been a while

589
00:40:04,199 --> 00:40:05,400
since I last made dumplings.

590
00:40:05,679 --> 00:40:07,960
I'm worried I'm getting rusty

591
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:11,519
and won't live up to your expectations.

592
00:40:11,920 --> 00:40:13,559
They look delicious. So hot.

593
00:40:15,159 --> 00:40:15,960
Blow on them.

594
00:40:20,039 --> 00:40:21,039
Here, try them. Try them.

595
00:40:21,199 --> 00:40:22,800
Let me toast you first.

596
00:40:24,800 --> 00:40:25,719
Why toast me?

597
00:40:28,960 --> 00:40:31,559
It's hard to give up a First-Class Merit.

598
00:40:32,199 --> 00:40:32,480
Cheers.

599
00:40:37,440 --> 00:40:40,559
At the world's end, my wife is all I have.

600
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,000
Who needs a First-Class Merit?

601
00:40:45,239 --> 00:40:47,159
Your sudden praise warms my heart.

602
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:05,360
Yuan Lai confessed everything.

603
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:07,719
Lu Haifeng's death

604
00:41:07,719 --> 00:41:09,039
really had no direct connection to you.

605
00:41:11,239 --> 00:41:12,039
She did it.

606
00:41:16,920 --> 00:41:18,400
She's also involved in Gangzi's death.

607
00:41:21,199 --> 00:41:22,480
When he took her hostage that day,

608
00:41:22,719 --> 00:41:24,639
Gangzi was ready to drop the knife.

609
00:41:25,159 --> 00:41:26,559
She feared the police would suspect her

610
00:41:27,519 --> 00:41:28,760
and worried that Gangzi would confess.

611
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:31,800
So during the standoff, she

612
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:34,079
intentionally got herself injured,

613
00:41:34,840 --> 00:41:35,960
forcing the Special Police to open fire.

614
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:49,840
I feel at ease.

615
00:41:53,199 --> 00:41:53,679
I feel at ease.

616
00:41:54,880 --> 00:41:55,639
My mind is at peace.

617
00:41:58,679 --> 00:42:01,360
God tested me with this First-Class Merit.

618
00:42:04,400 --> 00:42:04,760
Honey.

619
00:42:06,239 --> 00:42:07,199
Don't you think

620
00:42:07,719 --> 00:42:09,039
I stood the test?

621
00:42:14,119 --> 00:42:14,719
You did great.

622
00:42:21,960 --> 00:42:22,440
Come here.

623
00:42:35,559 --> 00:42:36,280
Hurry up and eat.

624
00:42:37,039 --> 00:42:38,840
Don't go home tonight.

625
00:42:47,679 --> 00:42:48,880
I felt so warm inside just now.

626
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:49,679
But the moment you said that,

627
00:42:49,679 --> 00:42:50,480
my... my heart...

628
00:42:52,119 --> 00:42:53,400
feels like it's on fire.

629
00:43:12,079 --> 00:43:13,760
It's never good news when you two show up.

630
00:43:13,920 --> 00:43:14,800
Preparing for the big competition.

631
00:43:14,920 --> 00:43:17,320
We have a solution now.

632
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:18,480
Would you like to hear it?

633
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:20,679
I'll serve as an auxiliary officer

634
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:22,280
and remain in the Special Police Unit.

635
00:43:22,840 --> 00:43:23,800
Your heart is back in it.

636
00:43:25,119 --> 00:43:27,000
Look straight ahead and focus on yourself.

637
00:43:27,119 --> 00:43:28,920
Even shaving off a single second

638
00:43:29,280 --> 00:43:31,480
is a victory over your past self.

639
00:43:31,800 --> 00:43:33,119
Come on, go all out.

640
00:43:33,559 --> 00:43:34,239
Just do it.
